domain SemanticProbeResult:
  description "Audit the observed rejection without retrying the consumed run."
evidence E1:
  "Live-result records one attempted network request, pending, activated=false and currentGenerationUnchanged=true. call-1-response HTTP400 body is: Unsupported response format. Self referenced definition are not supported. No usage, generated response or terminal accounting receipt was supplied."
evidence E2:
  "Retained response_format schema contains self-references in value.anyOf array.items and object.additionalProperties to definitions.character_semantic_migration_change_set_v1_properties_operations_items_properties_value; that definition contains the same references."
evidence E3:
  "Shared CharacterMigrationJsonSchema uses z.lazy recursive arrays and records. Operation.value uses it. character-migration-prompts serializes that schema with zodResponseFormat; the probe sends it unchanged as strict json_schema."
evidence E4:
  "Preparation tested an injected HTTP transport and server validation, not xAI schema acceptance; this limitation was disclosed. The reserved first-call cost was USD0.17413625, not an actual charge. SQLite path is /tmp/kshiai-semantic-probe-Me4suO."
premise ALTERNATIVES:
  "Schema self-recursion rejection matches both explicit HTTP400 and exact submitted references. Content semantics, token exhaustion or model reasoning are not evidenced causes of this pre-generation failure. Other unsupported schema features may still surface after correction; no absence of additional problems is claimed."
decision ROOT based_on E1, E2, E3, ALTERNATIVES:
  "C-PROBE-002 high confidence: the failure-producing integration choice was directly reusing the recursively typed generic JSON value schema as the provider strict-output grammar, whose submitted self-reference is rejected by this xAI endpoint. Recursive application typing is not inherently a defect; the incompatible boundary projection is. Library serialization preserves the recurrence and the adapter forwards it. This is not a model meaning-preservation failure."
decision ESCAPE based_on E4, ROOT:
  "Local fake transport did not enforce provider grammar restrictions; this explains why local checks passed, not what created the incompatible schema. Paid probe detected it at its first request. No generation, review or repair quality has been observed."
decision ACTION based_on ROOT, ESCAPE, E1, E4:
  "Record the consumed run and audit; preserve raw HTTP evidence and isolated DB, seal artifacts and update continuation. Do not retry, change schemas or claim zero cost. Report actual usage/cost unknown and reservation separately. Candidate correction for later approval is a provider-compatible nonrecursive projection derived from allowed typed target fields, retaining typed internal values and full server validation. A JSON-string workaround or relaxed output mode would be a separate design choice, not an automatic fix. Add provider grammar regression with any future correction; it does not itself fix the source boundary."
